{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Qi Fruit is a ",["l","水果","fruit"]," ",["l","农作物","crop"]," that grows from ",["l","齐豆","Qi Bean"],"s after 4 days. This fruit is only available during the ",["l","任务#Qi's Crop","\"Qi's Crop\" quest"],". Qi Fruit is one of only five crops that can grow into a ",["l","农作物#Giant Crops","giant crop"],"."]],["p",["All Qi Fruit and ",["l","齐豆","Qi Bean"],"s despawn when the quest is over (i.e., the day after the player ships them or the quest timer ends), including growing crops, all players' inventories, ",["l","宝箱","Chest"],"s, ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"],"s, ",["l","小桶","Keg"],"s, and ",["l","马龙","Marlon"],"'s ",["l","探险家公会#Item Recovery Service","Item Recovery Service"]," list."]],["p",["Giant Qi Fruit do not disappear when the quest is over, and they can be harvested during future quests to yield more Qi Fruit. If a player chops down a giant Qi Fruit when the \"Qi's Crop\" quest is not active, then they will receive one ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"]," instead of fruit. The first time this is done, ",["l","齐先生","Mr. Qi"]," will send a taunting message to the player."]],["p",["Qi Fruit is always normal quality."]]]],["Stages",2,[["p",["Qi Fruit can become a ",["l","农作物#Giant Crops","Giant Crop"],"."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Stage 1"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 2"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 3"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 4"]},{"h":1,"v":["Harvest"]}],[[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_3.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_4.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_5.png",48]]],[["1 Day"],["1 Day"],["1 Day"],["1 Day"],["Total: 4 Days"]]]]]],["Crop Growth Calendar",2,[["t",[[{"c":7,"h":1,"v":["Base"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Mon"]},{"h":1,"v":["Tue"]},{"h":1,"v":["Wed"]},{"h":1,"v":["Thu"]},{"h":1,"v":["Fri"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sat"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sun"]}],[[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_3.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_4.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit.png",48]],[["f","Qi_Fruit_Stage_2.